  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"K7h6o\" id=\"K7h6o\"><span data-lake-id=\"u690e2264\" id=\"u690e2264\">1. 第一个PyQt窗口</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20PyQt5.QtWidgets%20import%20QApplication%2CQWidget%5Cnimport%20sys%5Cn%5Cn%23%201.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%5Cnapp%20%3D%20QApplication(sys.argv)%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw%20%3D%20QWidget()%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw.show()%5Cn%5Cn%23%204.%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%5Cnsys.exit(app.exec())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lPY5y%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u654d43db\" id=\"u654d43db\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1e47ac8\" id=\"ud1e47ac8\">执行代码,就会显示PyQt窗口:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4be1ffe4\" id=\"u4be1ffe4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685234737294-d09c5137-15b5-493a-99b4-e15aae95bf60.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua4a8ca53-eabe-4c1f-8bfb-e9a5e479d27%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u51963f4e-aa16-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A321%2C%22originHeight%22%3A256%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uea859e3c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"zE6ms\" id=\"zE6ms\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5133b26\" id=\"uc5133b26\">2. PyQt模块简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud93cb34b\" id=\"ud93cb34b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e2c96f1\" id=\"u5e2c96f1\">PyQt中有非常多的功能模块，开发中最常用的功能模块主要有三个:</span></p><ul list=\"u00fe2886\"><li fid=\"ucfe38e9a\" data-lake-id=\"u0f6d36cb\" id=\"u0f6d36cb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u48b4f207\" id=\"u48b4f207\">QtCore</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u82dabd14\" id=\"u82dabd14\">：包含了核心的非GUI的功能。主要和时间、文件与文件夹、各种数据、流、URLs、mime类文件、进程与线程一起使用</span></li><li fid=\"ucfe38e9a\" data-lake-id=\"u6eca9b97\" id=\"u6eca9b97\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1fb756f8\" id=\"u1fb756f8\">QtGui</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u91c389e4\" id=\"u91c389e4\">：包含了窗口系统、事件处理、2D图像、基本绘画、字体和文字类</span></li><li fid=\"ucfe38e9a\" data-lake-id=\"u6316cb1e\" id=\"u6316cb1e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u575c5a71\" id=\"u575c5a71\">QtWidgets</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5a77c763\" id=\"u5a77c763\">：包含了一些列创建桌面应用的UI元素</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u281cf12c\" id=\"u281cf12c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1f811117\" id=\"u1f811117\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3c1bfc6b\" id=\"u3c1bfc6b\">PyQt的其它模块</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ufe1fd54c\" id=\"ufe1fd54c\"><ul list=\"u51f107cf\"><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u017f1500\" id=\"u017f1500\" class=\"lake-lineheight-15\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91992ec3\" id=\"u91992ec3\">QtMultimedia：负责处理多媒体的内容和调用摄像头</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"ua052d9e0\" id=\"ua052d9e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7cd815c5\" id=\"u7cd815c5\">QtBluetooth：负责查找和连接蓝牙</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u2d7a47ed\" id=\"u2d7a47ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc518da4e\" id=\"uc518da4e\">QtNetwork：负责网络编程</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u88bc9a98\" id=\"u88bc9a98\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b050229\" id=\"u9b050229\">QtPositioning：负责定位相关</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"ua2290f08\" id=\"ua2290f08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u164222fd\" id=\"u164222fd\">Enginio：包含了通过客户端进入和管理Qt Cloud</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"ubb3164bc\" id=\"ubb3164bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4083204f\" id=\"u4083204f\">QtWebSockets：实现了WebSocket协议</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u94e11312\" id=\"u94e11312\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a80fe69\" id=\"u9a80fe69\">QtWebKit：包含了一个基WebKit2的web浏览器QtWebKitWidgets:包含了基于QtWidgets的WebKit1的类</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"ubaa21795\" id=\"ubaa21795\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2bc45adb\" id=\"u2bc45adb\">QtXml：负责处理xm</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u7ae5dd05\" id=\"u7ae5dd05\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27840d05\" id=\"u27840d05\">QtSvg：负责显示SVG内容</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u80cb281d\" id=\"u80cb281d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e0c6b4b\" id=\"u1e0c6b4b\">QtSql：提供了处理数据库的工具。</span></li><li fid=\"u8823ee9e\" data-lake-id=\"u55257c12\" id=\"u55257c12\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubceb580e\" id=\"ubceb580e\">QtTest：提供了测试PyQt5应用的工具</span></li></ul></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id=\"E2tj6\" id=\"E2tj6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6fcfe294\" id=\"u6fcfe294\">3. 窗口标题和图标</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u182962c0\" id=\"u182962c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3290e08e\" id=\"u3290e08e\">应用程序图标是一个小的图像，通常在标题栏的左上角显示。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20PyQt5.QtWidgets%20import%20QApplication%2CQWidget%5Cnfrom%20PyQt5.QtGui%20import%20QIcon%5Cnimport%20sys%5Cn%5Cn%23%201.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%5Cnapp%20%3D%20QApplication(sys.argv)%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw%20%3D%20QWidget()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98%5Cnw.setWindowTitle('%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3')%5Cn%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%5Cnw.resize(400%2C%20300)%5Cn%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87%5Cnw.setWindowIcon(QIcon('qq.png'))%5Cn%5Cnw.setToolTip('%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B0%94%E6%B3%A1%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA')%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw.show()%5Cn%5Cn%23%204.%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%5Cnsys.exit(app.exec())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LwJCT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue8080724\" id=\"ue8080724\"><span data-lake-id=\"u82314c4a\" id=\"u82314c4a\">运行程序:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub0e857dc\" id=\"ub0e857dc\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685235622868-0a9588aa-5bfd-4b29-9af1-49ea2955dd27.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u580c4fe0-d235-4dd5-9b23-ce54e2436c2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u51963f4e-aa16-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A515.2%2C%22height%22%3A417%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A6881%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A644%2C%22originHeight%22%3A521%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%20%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B0%94%E6%B3%A1%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A16%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A131%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A16%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B0%94%E6%B3%A1%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0fbaf21c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p>",
